WEBVTT

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:06.200
Exerting oneself to the utmost, 
then to finally perish! The joy of it!

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.370
The sheer bliss!

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.870
Monkey, lend me your Regalia.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.340
You are worthy of 
having your life ended by me,

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.250
Destroyer-King!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.280
The Destroyer-King...

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.110
Nobu... are you...

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:27.710
I will obtain power!

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.060
Nobu?

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:32.750
I will go to Yomotsuhirasaka
 and obtain the ley lines' power.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.950
If you do not wish to risk your lives, leave!

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:41.220
I <i>will</i> return with power 
that can defeat Alexander!

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:47.230
Until then, protect the weak,
 see to your own lives, and survive!

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:50.830
Yes, my lord!

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:53.790
Meet the dragons?

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:55.820
Yomotsuhirasaka is where

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.550
generations of Yamatai's
 rulers have gone to face trials.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.930
If one crosses the barrier with that intent,

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:04.610
it will transform into a
 dimension where dragons dwell.

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:12.120
It will also be a place where the 
living may speak with the dead.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.140
Life and death,

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.060
rebirth and destruction,

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.030
where two different dimensions overlap...

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:23.770
So it may conceal even the
 secret behind this world's creation.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.350
In order to obtain power,

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.170
one must face the dragons.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:29.230
Face?

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.230
Wise beyond measure,

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.140
yet horrifying at the same time,

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:36.190
the dragons are a
 mirror of one's own strength.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:40.590
Powerful dragons will 
appear before the strong.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.980
If the dragons accept my betrothed,

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:45.290
he can gain power.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.380
And if he cannot?

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.080
He will be lost in the land of the dead

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.160
and never return to the world of the living.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:55.160
Are you willing to let Sir Nobunaga go?

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.530
What are you worried about?

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:01.170
My betrothed will succeed in his task.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.660
Monkey, I will never let you die.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:14.240
My betrothed will
 challenge the West once more.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:17.680
For his sake,
 I cannot let his right-hand man die!

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:23.240
Mitsu...

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:24.620
What is it?

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.600
I leave the castle to you.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.140
You will return alive. Why...

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.190
Yes, I will return.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:38.850
But the forces of the West know no mercy.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:41.610
In my absence, please protect the people.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.410
It's as if you will not return.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:50.690
No, I will.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.590
But I cannot tell how
 much time it will take.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.860
May I ask one thing?

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:01.560
Will you truly use the
 power you obtain for the people?

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.450
My oath to you and Monkey is not a lie.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:14.080
But I failed to protect them, yet again.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.950
That is why I need power!

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:27.280
We cannot let the Westerners 
trample us into the ground.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.020
Right.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.080
Did you come to see me off?

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:33.890
No, I'm coming with you.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.950
And what will that accomplish?

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.160
I don't know.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.490
But I can at least be your shield.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.660
I need no shield to face the dragons.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:44.920
Then I, too, will face the dragons

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:46.510
so I can obtain a stronger shield.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.690
Do as you wish.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:04.790
Uesugi Kenshin...

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:14.970
Sir Kenshin, pick one.

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:18.750
It is a fortune-telling of sorts.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.480
Do you mean to read my mind with these?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.650
Ah, the Wheel of Fortune.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:34.250
This card is asking you

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:38.270
if you are prepared to accept any fate.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:41.940
Even if that fate may be death.

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.640
You may think you are reading my mind

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.640
by watching my eye movements,

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.140
but my eyes are not so truthful.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.280
The fate known as death...

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.380
I cannot accept it just yet.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.390
As you wish.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.690
Of the three,

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.810
who will return alive?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.160
Or will none return?

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:19.880
It appears Sir Nobunaga has entrusted
 this castle to you in his absence.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:23.870
Then the rest is up to you.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:34.420
Oda Nobunaga, why do you seek power?

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.650
To unite heaven and earth.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:37.940
Hm.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:42.420
So you wish to obtain power for 
the people, and not for yourself?

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.930
I, myself, seek power 
only for my own purposes.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:51.120
I wish to become even more powerful

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:53.940
and become the most
 powerful person in the world.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:59.790
To influence others is 
nothing more than conceit.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.450
I am not trying to influence others, either.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.160
Very well.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.160
I will face the dragons of 
Yomotsuhirasaka and obtain power.

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:14.820
First, I will avenge my 
humiliation by Alexander.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.330
Then, I will defeat you.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.330
Do as you will.

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:26.470
Will Nobu return with greater power?

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.820
He has said that he will use that power

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.270
to unite heaven and earth, but...

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.920
Ichihime-sama?!

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:48.290
Wh-Where is Caesar-dono?

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.100
Is there nothing more for me to do,

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:55.180
as one who does not possess a Regalia?

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:56.820
Are you in darkness?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.420
Da Vinci-dono.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.860
The Wheel of Fortune?

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.180
You can hear the dragons breathing.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:21.860
Indeed.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:27.130
I once wandered here 
by accident when I was a boy.

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:28.640
When you were a boy?

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.290
You were allowed to pass these gates

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.120
even before you possessed a Regalia?

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:37.870
Very well.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.390
Why?

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.250
Is it because I'm from the West?

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:50.820
Oh, wait!

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.040
Nobunaga!

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.040
Wait, Nobunaga!

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:00.640
Nobunaga.

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:02.900
Ranmaru?

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.800
So you've finally come.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.110
Lord Shingen?

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.860
So you have come to obtain power?

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.310
Indeed.

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:39.230
I have come here to obtain unshakable power.

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.280
Ha, unshakable power.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:43.740
How absurd.

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:46.110
How so?

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.850
I came here craving
 power to strengthen myself!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.360
Strengthen yourself, eh?

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:55.720
Then what sacrifices are you willing to make?

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:58.290
Sacrifices, you say?

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:01.260
What would constitute unshakable power?

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:06.010
I believe it is absolute
 power that dominates all others.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:10.810
Then you believe you are capable of 
containing such a power within yourself?

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.300
But of course.

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.570
Know humility!

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.920
Why am I not acceptable?

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.390
Because you fear the prophecies

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.660
and bear ill will toward your own self.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:40.950
What?

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.060
Me?

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.590
How despicable!

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:48.950
How accursed!

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.530
How tainted!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.000
Jeanne is demon-possessed!

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:53.810
Demon-possessed!

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.580
Stop!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:56.610
Stop!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:08.870
The prophecies...

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.770
The source of calamity!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.330
That's not true!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.400
Accept the truth!

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:15.100
They are a pestilence.

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:17.600
No!

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:19.330
Accept the sin and blame! All of it!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.400
Nobunaga...

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:27.810
Let's see this resolve of yours, fool-brat.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.210
What do you wish to do, Brother?

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.330
Nobukatsu... you're...

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.770
Warriors only try to save 
their own skin, don't they?

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.500
Bro, I'm hungry.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.120
Asahi.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:45.950
The Oda lord said he'd let us live, but...

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.040
Brother, what do you wish to do?

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.100
Dad?!

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.860
Nobunaga...
 you should not have come here.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:06.550
Why do you say that?

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.970
What will you do once you obtain power?

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.870
Is it to wage battle with the West?

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:13.170
That's right.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.560
At this rate,

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.830
the Star of the East will walk to its destruction.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.860
Destruction...

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:22.170
Who knew the word would pass your lips?

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:27.570
Do you mean to say that you are
 prepared to sacrifice your own life

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:30.210
in order to protect the people...
 or the Star itself?

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:32.630
I will not run.

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:33.680
I will not be defeated!

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:42.620
Dad, I couldn't protect you then.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.420
But things have changed!

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.250
I came here to protect the people

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.690
and to unite heaven and earth!

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:53.800
Then show me this resolve of yours.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:16.720
Nobu-sama!

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:21.490
Monkey?!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:23.390
Nobu-sama!

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:26.400
It is not yet time for you to 
come to the land of the dead!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:27.400
Go back.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.130
Go back, Monkey!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:32.950
No!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:39.470
The rest is up to you.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:44.480
There are times when the 
wise supersede the strong.

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:52.120
Why do you follow Sir Nobunaga?

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.120
That's not how I see it.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.910
Noh is a splendid art that 
represents this star's aesthetics

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:01.630
regarding the mysterious 
beauty of the universe.

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:05.040
When the mask tilts down into shadow,
 it expresses grief.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:09.170
Its morose expression makes it
 seem as though it's looking at you.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.870
And when it's lifted into the light, see...

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.970
It suddenly looks as 
though it's laughing now.

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:20.150
I'd like to see you like this, as well.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.760
All is due to light and dark,

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.660
and the curious angles 
created by their interplay.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.890
All men seek to see
 the world as they desire it.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:34.160
I'd like to overcome that.

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:38.660
Should Sir Nobunaga not return,

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:43.310
Sir Mitsuhide,
 you will rule heaven and earth.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.390
If that time comes,

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:48.660
will you be smiling like this?

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.050
Or, will you feel grief?

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:54.320
What are you saying?

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.500
"What if I possess a Regalia?"

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.810
Have you ever had that thought?

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:04.520
As an observer of all creation,

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.550
I am creating a certain painting.

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.930
I've titled it <i>The Last Supper</i>.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.800
The Last Supper?

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:12.520
It depicts the Savior-King

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:16.440
and his twelve followers who would 
influence the fate of the two stars,

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:19.120
no, of the entire universe.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.930
Should I include you in this painting?

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:31.780
Or perhaps the question is, is it Arthur 
whom I should place in its center?

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:33.060
Or is it Nobunaga?

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:36.190
Or, is it you?

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:45.800
Ichihime-sama?

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.700
Mitsuhide, what is your dream?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.200
My dream?

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.440
That would be to have Nobunaga unite—

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:56.440
No, that is my brother's dream.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.310
What is your own dream?

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.750
My dream is...

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:01.940
Ichihime...

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.050
Ichihime-sama!

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.640
Avenge me.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.810
Mitsuhide-sama.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:15.600
Have you forgotten your desire 
to restore the Akechi clan?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.540
Kagome... you...

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:22.300
I would like you to fulfill that desire.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.990
Mitsuhide-sama, do not fail us.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.490
Stop.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:54.600
Please stop.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.030
That would be simple.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:01.330
You must simply accept the 
prophecies as your own voice.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:02.610
Why do you resist?

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:04.360
Because of the prophecies...

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:07.300
Because I voiced them,

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.830
I called forth disaster.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:10.350
That is why.

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:12.350
Is that not because you, yourself,

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:16.120
refuse to fully accept your prophecies?

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:17.590
Stop!

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:19.360
I don't want to hear anymore!

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:26.030
I don't want to bring misfortune 
to anyone! That's all I want!

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:29.370
Then accept the prophecies 
as a part of yourself!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.710
Then I would rather...

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:44.620
The dragon that appears 
here is one's own mirror.

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:48.080
Powerful dragons will 
appear before the strong.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.080
I see.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.730
That means this must be my power.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:00.740
This, too, is my fate.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.060
This is the Wheel of Fortune.

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:14.370
Then I shall strike 
the Wheel of Fortune down!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.120
Be vanquished!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.590
My attack... struck myself?

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:49.920
Bro, save me...

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:53.420
Brother, save me.

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:56.060
Nobu... naga...

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:57.620
Save us!

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.110
No!

00:19:58.110 --> 00:19:59.810
It hurts!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.060
Save us!

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:05.070
Dragon, is that your true self?

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.050
I see.

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:10.970
That's how you suffered.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:13.540
The reason I could not save you all...

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.610
No. The reason I hurt you all 
was because of my immaturity.

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:22.410
I accept all of your pain in its entirety!

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:25.120
Dragon, devour me!

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:30.130
I will accept all of your pain,
 all of your suffering!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:43.870
Listen, Ranmaru!

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.640
Ranmaru, are you my companion?

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:49.630
Yes!

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:50.850
That's why I've come so far!

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:52.830
Then hesitate no more.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.400
Accept the prophecies!

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.140
What?

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.850
I will accept you, along with your prophecies.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.360
Nobunaga...

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:01.430
Do not worry!

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:02.650
I am with you!

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.970
Follow the prophecies

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.820
and press onward without fear!

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:09.500
All right, Nobunaga.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:13.190
If that's what you say... 
I will no longer hesitate.

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:17.580
I... will accept the prophecies!

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:30.930
Nobunaga.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:35.190
A dragon?

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:42.950
By offering himself to the dragon,

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:44.230
he has gained honor.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:03.690
The Lord!

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:05.660
Nobunaga-sama has returned!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.140
Nobu.

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:14.760
Mitsu, I'm back.

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:20.100
Unfortunately, we do not
 know of Lord Kenshin's safety.

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:24.990
You have returned... I see.

00:22:33.190 --> 00:22:35.210
Destiny continues onward...

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:38.360
Yes, toward the Last Supper.

00:24:11.960 --> 00:24:14.320
A lone light shines through 
the darkness of a world

00:24:14.320 --> 00:24:16.270
that knows not what love is.

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.890
I will protect that light, 
no matter what the cost.

00:24:19.550 --> 00:24:21.380
Next time: The Sun.

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:24.060
I will deliver you its warmth.
